From ef33136e20a1634d29b42dc20343a235c889700d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Klemm <github@tklemm.eu>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:41:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Prototype: deprecated UrlHelper stand-ins for the methods
 moved to NavigationHelper

Record only. UrlHelper defines link_to, button_to, current_page? and the
link_to_if family again; each warns and calls NavigationHelper's method
on the receiver. NavigationHelper's private helpers move into UrlHelper
so the bound methods find them.
---
 .../action_view/helpers/navigation_helper.rb  | 115 ----------------
 .../lib/action_view/helpers/url_helper.rb     | 128 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 128 insertions(+), 115 deletions(-)

